     A*---------------------------------------------------------
     A* IRCCHATD - IRC Chat Panel Display File (Phase 7)
     A*
     A* Three record formats:
     A*   CHATOUT - rows 1-23 (header + 19 chat + Fkeys)
     A*   CHATIN  - row 24    (1-line input, INVITE)  small mode
     A*   CHATBIG - rows 13-23 (separator + 9 input lines, INVITE)
     A*                       big mode; OVERLAY masks chat rows
     A*                       13-22 with the input area.
     A*
     A* F11 toggles between small and big mode. ENTER in big
     A* mode concatenates BIG01..BIG09 and sends a PRIVMSG to
     A* the current channel. F3/F12 exit. F5 refreshes.
     A*---------------------------------------------------------
     A                                      DSPSIZ(24 80 *DS3)
     A                                      CA03(03 'Exit')
     A                                      CA05(05 'Refresh')
     A                                      CA11(68 'Toggle big')
     A                                      CA12(12 'Cancel')
     A          R CHATOUT
     A                                      OVERLAY
     A                                      FRCDTA
     A                                  1  2'STRIRC'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU) DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  1 30'IRC Chat'
     A                                      COLOR(WHT) DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  1 62'System:'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A            S1SYS          8A  O  1 72
     A                                      COLOR(WHT)
     A                                  2  2'Window:'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A            S1WIN         24A  O  2 10
     A                                      COLOR(TRQ) DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  2 50'Nick:'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A            S1NCK         16A  O  2 56
     A                                      COLOR(YLW) DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  2'----------------------------------'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A                                  3 38'----------------------------------'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
