     A          R CHATIN
     A                                      OVERLAY
     A                                      INVITE
     A                                 24  2'>'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU) DSPATR(HI)
     A            INPUT         76A  B 24  4
     A                                      DSPATR(MDT)
